    "summary": "Coinbase has received a Financial Services Permission from Abu Dhabi's FSRA to arrange and custody tokenised securities at an international hub in ADGM.\nThe post Coinbase Wins ADGM Licence to Build Tokenised Securities Hub appeared first on The Fintech Times.",
    "hasSummary": true,
